Notice that changes are listed in reverse chronological order.

$Header: //components/dev/hdr.mpss/1.0/weixians.Nikel40_full_0730/srch/src/hdrsrchard_sm.smf#1 $ $DateTime: 2003/06/14 17:48:10 $ $Author: coresvc $

when       who     what, where, why
--------   ---     ----------------------------------------------------------
10/14/16   vke     Fix to support mode grant in sleep state
08/06/15   wsh     Report sleep mode while tuneaway, to get preferred config
07/15/15   wsh     Fixed RxAGC collection stopped after QTA
06/30/15   tnp     Update copyright info
02/04/15   wsh     Added support 2->2a transition, removed PA on requirement
01/29/20   wsh     Lowered AGC count required, Fixed dec timer for QTA
10/09/14   wsh     Added support for DR-DSDS ASDiv
03/05/14   wsh     Bug fixes for DSDS-ASDiv and DSDA-ASDiv support 
01/15/14   wsh     Added DSDS ASDiv support
12/18/13   wsh     Process timer expiration in inactive
04/12/12   wsh     Initial Implementation
